concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-11-2-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11(3) Entity definitions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-11-2-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Each of the following is an excluded entity: (aa) the National Data Commissioner and any APS employee made available to the National Data Commissioner under section 47; (a) the National Anti-Corruption Commission; (ab) the Inspector of the National Anti-Corruption Commission; (b) the agency known as the Australian Criminal Intelligence Commission established by the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002; (ba) the Australian Federal Police; (c) that part of the Defence Department known as the Australian Geospatial-Intelligence Organisation; (d) the Australian National Audit Office; (e) the Australian Secret Intelligence Service; (f) the Australian Security Intelligence Organisation; (g) the Australian Signals Directorate; (h) that part of the Defence Department known as the Defence Intelligence Organisation;  Chapter 1  Preliminary" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Each of the following is an excluded entity: (aa) the National Data Commissioner and any APS employee made available to the National Data Commissioner under section 47; (a) the National Anti-Corruption Commission; (ab) the Inspector of the National Anti-Corruption Commission; (b) the agency known as the Australian Criminal Intelligence Commission established by the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002; (ba) the Australian Federal Police; (c) that part of the Defence Department known as the Australian Geospatial-Intelligence Organisation; (d) the Australian National Audit Office; (e) the Australian Secret Intelligence Service; (f) the Australian Security Intelligence Organisation; (g) the Australian Signals Directorate; (h) that part of the Defence Department known as the Defence Intelligence Organisation;  Chapter 1  Preliminary"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f712b91e3ad43641262f5120dfb0a254a5f4c3f0dd069029dd5d3c3abdf44e58" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-11-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "List of excluded entities" ;
