concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-11a-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11A(5) The data sharing project"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-11a-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A data sharing agreement may treat multiple projects as a single project, as long as they all have the same data sharing purpose or purposes and the same sharer and user and (if applicable) intermediary.  Chapter 1  Preliminary" ;
    skos:definition "(5) A data sharing agreement may treat multiple projects as a single project, as long as they all have the same data sharing purpose or purposes and the same sharer and user and (if applicable) intermediary.  Chapter 1  Preliminary"@en ;
