doc:sec-15-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15(3) Data sharing purposes" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) An enforcement related purpose means any of the following purposes: (a) detecting, investigating, prosecuting or punishing: (i) an offence; or (ii) a contravention of a law punishable by a pecuniary penalty; (b) detecting, investigating or addressing acts or practices detrimental to public revenue; (c) detecting, investigating or remedying serious misconduct; (d) conducting surveillance or monitoring, or intelligence-gathering activities; (e) conducting protective or custodial activities; (f) enforcing a law relating to the confiscation of proceeds of crime; (g) preparing for, or conducting, proceedings before a court or tribunal or implementing a court/tribunal order. Note: The purpose of verifying that a government payment previously made to a person was correctly made is an example of an enforcement related purpose. Other examples include the purpose of recovering overpayments, identifying individuals for compliance activity and identifying individuals for the purposes of exercising statutory investigation powers." ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-15-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15(4) Data sharing purposes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A purpose is not a precluded purpose within the meaning of paragraph (2)(a) or (b) if the purpose is both: (a) a data sharing purpose; and (b) a purpose that: (i) is with respect to matters that relate only in a general way to a purpose mentioned in paragraph (2)(a) or (b); and  Chapter 2  Authorisations" ;
    skos:definition "(4) A purpose is not a precluded purpose within the meaning of paragraph (2)(a) or (b) if the purpose is both: (a) a data sharing purpose; and (b) a purpose that: (i) is with respect to matters that relate only in a general way to a purpose mentioned in paragraph (2)(a) or (b); and  Chapter 2  Authorisations"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0c20082234a9ddaf830451fe34acc8218f9e5ad6da00c66d78620716f6828adb" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-15 ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Purpose is not precluded if it relates to matters in a general way to another purpose." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf> ;
    dc:source "data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf, p.38" ;
    cml:asserts concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-15-ss-4-norm .
