concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-16c-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16C(2) Project involving use of de-identification or secure access data"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-16c-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The data sharing agreement that covers the project must require the service to be performed by one of the following: (a) the data custodian of the data, if the data custodian is not an ADSP but is satisfied that it has the appropriate skills and experience to perform the service; (b) the data custodian of the data, if the data custodian is an ADSP able to perform such a service consistently with its conditions of accreditation; (c) an ADSP able to perform such a service consistently with its conditions of accreditation.  Authorisations  Chapter 2 Privacy protections  Part 2.4  Section 16D Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The data sharing agreement that covers the project must require the service to be performed by one of the following: (a) the data custodian of the data, if the data custodian is not an ADSP but is satisfied that it has the appropriate skills and experience to perform the service; (b) the data custodian of the data, if the data custodian is an ADSP able to perform such a service consistently with its conditions of accreditation; (c) an ADSP able to perform such a service consistently with its conditions of accreditation.  Authorisations  Chapter 2 Privacy protections  Part 2.4  Section 16D Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024"@en ;
