doc:sec-16c-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "16C(2) Project involving use of de-identification or secure access data" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The data sharing agreement that covers the project must require the service to be performed by one of the following: (a) the data custodian of the data, if the data custodian is not an ADSP but is satisfied that it has the appropriate skills and experience to perform the service; (b) the data custodian of the data, if the data custodian is an ADSP able to perform such a service consistently with its conditions of accreditation; (c) an ADSP able to perform such a service consistently with its conditions of accreditation.  Authorisations  Chapter 2 Privacy protections  Part 2.4  Section 16D Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024" ;
    cof:pageNumber "46"^^xsd:integer .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-16c-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16C(3) Project involving use of de-identification or secure access data"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-16c-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A de-identification data service is a service to treat data that includes personal information so that the data is de-identified, using techniques that restrict the data being used in a way that would have the result that the data ceases to be de-identified." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A de-identification data service is a service to treat data that includes personal information so that the data is de-identified, using techniques that restrict the data being used in a way that would have the result that the data ceases to be de-identified."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0f944c3f6f4906cddbfd55e62c73ef3b18b69eb9c5ba9b16d26ddf5c6a56c612" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-16c ;
    cof:pageNumber "46"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Service must treat data with personal information to de-identify it using techniques that restrict its use." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf> ;
    dc:source "data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf, p.46" ;
    cml:asserts concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-16c-ss-3-norm .
