    values:originalText "(2) The data sharing agreement that covers the project must require the service to be performed by one of the following: (a) the data custodian of the data, if the data custodian is an ADSP able to perform such a service consistently with its conditions of accreditation; (b) an ADSP able to perform such a service consistently with its conditions of accreditation." ;
