concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-16d-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16D(3) Project involving complex data integration services"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-16d-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A service to integrate data is a complex data integration service if: (a) 2 or more entities control the data being integrated; and (b) the data is at the unit or micro level; and (c) any of the following subparagraphs applies to any of the data to be integrated, or to the integrated data: (i) the data includes personal information;  Chapter 2  Authorisations" ;
    skos:definition "(3) A service to integrate data is a complex data integration service if: (a) 2 or more entities control the data being integrated; and (b) the data is at the unit or micro level; and (c) any of the following subparagraphs applies to any of the data to be integrated, or to the integrated data: (i) the data includes personal information;  Chapter 2  Authorisations"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ef60a578b10ee15bf4ca06ceb7f5a3a7be64ea78482b357ae678afac1f249186" ;
