    values:originalText "(3) A service to integrate data is a complex data integration service if: (a) 2 or more entities control the data being integrated; and (b) the data is at the unit or micro level; and (c) any of the following subparagraphs applies to any of the data to be integrated, or to the integrated data: (i) the data includes personal information;  Chapter 2  Authorisations" ;
