    values:originalText "(1A) The requirements in this section must be met by all data sharing agreements. Note: There are other requirements that, depending on the nature of the project, must be met by some data sharing agreements. See sections 16A and 16B." ;
    cof:pageNumber "56"^^xsd:integer .

