doc:sec-19-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "19(5) Requirements to be met by all data sharing agreements" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) The agreement must specify the title of any law that the sharing would contravene but for section 23 (authorisation to share overrides other laws)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "56"^^xsd:integer .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-19-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19(6) Requirements to be met by all data sharing agreements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-19-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) The agreement must: (a) specify: (i) the data sharing purpose, or data sharing purposes, of the project; and (ii) if, under the agreement, the accredited user is to be allowed to use output of the project for any purpose incidental to that purpose or those purposes—any such incidental purpose; and (b) except in relation to any use of the output allowed in accordance with section 20D—prohibit the accredited user from collecting and using output of the project for any of the following: (i) any purpose not specified; (ii) any precluded purpose." ;
    skos:definition "(6) The agreement must: (a) specify: (i) the data sharing purpose, or data sharing purposes, of the project; and (ii) if, under the agreement, the accredited user is to be allowed to use output of the project for any purpose incidental to that purpose or those purposes—any such incidental purpose; and (b) except in relation to any use of the output allowed in accordance with section 20D—prohibit the accredited user from collecting and using output of the project for any of the following: (i) any purpose not specified; (ii) any precluded purpose."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d2b59aadca50264b2e4e55d9f92caaeb7f1baef44f831b1e8544c72fdb6a47ce" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-19 ;
    cof:pageNumber "56"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prohibit accredited user from collecting and using output of the project for certain purposes." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf> ;
    dc:source "data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf, p.56" ;
    cml:asserts concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-19-ss-6-norm .
