concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-19-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19(7) Requirements to be met by all data sharing agreements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-19-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) The agreement must specify how the project will be consistent with the data sharing principles, including by: (a) describing how the public interest is served by the project; and (b) specifying the actions the party will take to give effect to the principles." ;
    skos:definition "(7) The agreement must specify how the project will be consistent with the data sharing principles, including by: (a) describing how the public interest is served by the project; and (b) specifying the actions the party will take to give effect to the principles."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ee452f63de00d2df1916a97270b45cf037b41eebed59b6c8bb32bc9153c5c574" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-19 ;
