concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-20b-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20B(3) Allowed access: providing access to output for validation or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-20b-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Providing access to output in accordance with a term of a data sharing agreement allowed by this section is taken to be for the data sharing purpose, or data sharing purposes, of the project." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Providing access to output in accordance with a term of a data sharing agreement allowed by this section is taken to be for the data sharing purpose, or data sharing purposes, of the project."@en ;
