concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-20e-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20E(7) Exit of ADSP-enhanced data or output of project"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-20e-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) The user in a project is taken to hold a copy of output of the project that has exited the data sharing scheme, from the time specified for exit of the output in the data sharing agreement that covers the project, if:  Chapter 2  Authorisations" ;
    skos:definition "(7) The user in a project is taken to hold a copy of output of the project that has exited the data sharing scheme, from the time specified for exit of the output in the data sharing agreement that covers the project, if:  Chapter 2  Authorisations"@en ;
