    cof:title "20F(3) Data custodian of output of project" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The conditions for exit of the output are that: (a) provision of access to, or release of, the output by the user would not contravene any other law of the Commonwealth or a law of a State or Territory (disregarding section 23 of this Act); and  Authorisations  Chapter 2 Allowed access to output of project  Part 2.7  Section 20F Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (b) if the output includes personal information about an individual—the individual has expressly consented to their personal information being used by the user without the requirements of this Act applying to the use; and (c) the agreement requires the data custodian of the source data to be satisfied that all requirements in the agreement relating to exit of the output are met before the time specified in the agreement for the exit." ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-20f-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20F(4) Data custodian of output of project"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-20f-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Unless appointed as mentioned in subsection (2), the user in the project is not the data custodian of output of the project. This subsection has effect despite subparagraph 11(2)(c)(i)." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Unless appointed as mentioned in subsection (2), the user in the project is not the data custodian of output of the project. This subsection has effect despite subparagraph 11(2)(c)(i)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bbf2fe24b0662e34465624f194fd7eb9f943ae6cf633a54503ad08e0f59e9d10" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-20f ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "User must be appointed data custodian of output unless otherwise specified." ;
