doc:sec-20f-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20F(4) Data custodian of output of project" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) Unless appointed as mentioned in subsection (2), the user in the project is not the data custodian of output of the project. This subsection has effect despite subparagraph 11(2)(c)(i)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-20f-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20F(5) Data custodian of output of project"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-20f-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A data sharing agreement that covers a project may appoint an entity that is party to the agreement, other than in the capacity of user, as the data custodian of specified output of the project, if: (a) the entity is a Commonwealth body; and (b) the entity is not an excluded entity; and (c) the output is public sector data and not a copy of the shared data collected by the user; and (d) the agreement allows the user to provide the entity with access to the output in circumstances allowed by section 20C.  Chapter 2  Authorisations" ;
    skos:definition "(5) A data sharing agreement that covers a project may appoint an entity that is party to the agreement, other than in the capacity of user, as the data custodian of specified output of the project, if: (a) the entity is a Commonwealth body; and (b) the entity is not an excluded entity; and (c) the output is public sector data and not a copy of the shared data collected by the user; and (d) the agreement allows the user to provide the entity with access to the output in circumstances allowed by section 20C.  Chapter 2  Authorisations"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d746ed55cebdf113bc02dd0b718c6194c9d4a96f6b303bc9d19b92edd51f7121" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-20f ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Appoints data custodian for specified output of project under certain conditions." ;
