concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-23 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23 Authorisations override other laws"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The authorisations in sections 13, 13A, 13B and 13C have effect despite anything in another law of the Commonwealth, or a law of a State or Territory. Note: These authorisations extend to individuals (see section 124). (2) Subsection (1) applies in relation to a law enacted before or after the commencement of this Act.  Responsibilities of data scheme entities  Chapter 3 Introduction  Part 3.1  Section 24 Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 Chapter 3—Responsibilities of data scheme entities" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The authorisations in sections 13, 13A, 13B and 13C have effect despite anything in another law of the Commonwealth, or a law of a State or Territory. Note: These authorisations extend to individuals (see section 124). (2) Subsection (1) applies in relation to a law enacted before or after the commencement of this Act.  Responsibilities of data scheme entities  Chapter 3 Introduction  Part 3.1  Section 24 Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 Chapter 3—Responsibilities of data scheme entities"@en ;
