    cof:title "34(2) Assist Commissioner in relation to annual report" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A data custodian must give the Commissioner any other information and assistance the Commissioner reasonably requires  Responsibilities of data scheme entities  Chapter 3 General responsibilities  Part 3.2  Section 34 Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 in relation to the preparation of the annual report mentioned in section 138." ;
