concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-34-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "34(3) Assist Commissioner in relation to annual report"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-34-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) An entity that was an accredited entity at any time during a financial year must give the Commissioner any information and assistance the Commissioner reasonably requires in relation to the preparation of the annual report for the financial year mentioned in section 138." ;
