    cml:logicSummary "Spread of information about data breach" ;
    cml:premiseText "Information about data breach must be spread to entities, groups of entities and things affected by the breach." ;
    cml:conclusionText "The data custodian's action to prevent or reduce harm within the specified period is related to the prevention of harm from data breach and the spread of information about the breach." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::diffusion" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-36-ss-2 cml:asserts concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-36-ss-2-logic-cogai-5 .
concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-36-ss-2-logic-cogai-5 a cml:LogicApplication ;
    cml:modality cml:CogAI ;
    cml:operator "<=>" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Artificial intelligence application in preventing data breach" ;
    cml:premiseText "Artificial intelligence can be applied to prevent or reduce harm from data breach." ;
    cml:conclusionText "The data custodian's action to prevent or reduce harm within the specified period is related to the application of artificial intelligence in preventing data breach." ;
    cml:executionSurface "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sec-36-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "36(2) Take steps to mitigate data breach" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If: (a) a data custodian reasonably suspects or becomes aware that a data breach of an accredited entity has occurred; and (b) the data breach involves scheme data that is output, or ADSP-enhanced data, of a project in which the data custodian shared public sector data with or through the accredited entity; the data custodian must, within the period applicable under subsection (3), take reasonable steps to prevent or reduce any harm  Responsibilities of data scheme entities  Chapter 3 Data breach responsibilities  Part 3.3  Section 37 Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 resulting from the breach to entities, groups of entities and things to which the data involved in the breach relates. Civil penalty: 300 penalty units." ;
    cof:pageNumber "72"^^xsd:integer .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-36-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36(3) Take steps to mitigate data breach"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-36-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The period for taking the steps is: (a) the period applicable under a data code; or (b) if there is no period applicable under a data code—as soon as practicable after the breach occurs." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The period for taking the steps is: (a) the period applicable under a data code; or (b) if there is no period applicable under a data code—as soon as practicable after the breach occurs."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a14e42841ef6cdda6927e9b0628a3fd5212f327eac5637d085f305b6af1371b6" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-36 ;
    cof:pageNumber "72"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Steps must be taken after a data breach occurs." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf> ;
    dc:source "data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf, p.72" ;
    cml:asserts concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-36-ss-3-norm .
