doc:sec-43 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "43 Advice related functions" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of paragraph 42(1)(a), the Commissioner’s advice related functions are to do the following, on request by the Minister or on the Commissioner’s own initiative:  National Data Commissioner and National Data Advisory Council  Chapter 4 National Data Commissioner  Part 4.2 Establishment, functions and powers  Division 1 Section 44 Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (a) advise on matters relating to the operation of this Act, including Commonwealth laws and changes to Commonwealth laws relating to this Act; (aa) advise a data scheme entity about how, in the Commissioner’s opinion, the data sharing scheme applies, or would apply in particular circumstances, in relation to the entity; (ab) advise the Minister in relation to the exercise of the Minister’s powers under Part 5.2 (accreditation framework); (b) inform the Minister about actions to be taken by data scheme entities in order to comply with this Act; (c) report and make recommendations to the Minister in relation to this Act, or the need for or desirability of legislative or administrative action in relation to this Act." ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-44 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44 Guidance related functions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44 ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of paragraph 42(1)(b), the Commissioner’s guidance related functions are to make: (a) data codes under section 126; and (b) guidelines under section 127." ;
    skos:definition "For the purposes of paragraph 42(1)(b), the Commissioner’s guidance related functions are to make: (a) data codes under section 126; and (b) guidelines under section 127."@en ;
