concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-46 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46 Application of finance law"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-46 ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013), the Commissioner is an official of the Department." ;
