doc:sec-50-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "50(1) Delegation by Commissioner" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner may, in writing, delegate to a member of the staff mentioned in section 47 any or all of the Commissioner’s functions or powers under: (a) this Act; or (b) the rules; or (c) the Regulatory Powers Act as it applies in relation to this Act. Note: Sections 34AA to 34A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 contain provisions relating to delegations." ;
    cof:pageNumber "81"^^xsd:integer .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-50-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "50(2) Delegation by Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-50-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Despite subsection (1), the Commissioner must not delegate: (a) functions or powers under the following provisions: (i) section 112 (directions); (ii) section 126 (data codes); (iii) section 127 (guidelines); or (b) a regulatory function, or a power in relation to a regulatory function, to the extent that the function would be performed, or the power exercised, by a delegate in relation to the Department in which the delegate is an APS employee; or (c) functions or powers under Part 4.3 (National Data Advisory Council).  Chapter 4  National Data Commissioner and National Data Advisory Council" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Despite subsection (1), the Commissioner must not delegate: (a) functions or powers under the following provisions: (i) section 112 (directions); (ii) section 126 (data codes); (iii) section 127 (guidelines); or (b) a regulatory function, or a power in relation to a regulatory function, to the extent that the function would be performed, or the power exercised, by a delegate in relation to the Department in which the delegate is an APS employee; or (c) functions or powers under Part 4.3 (National Data Advisory Council).  Chapter 4  National Data Commissioner and National Data Advisory Council"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5dbab9527555ca82c111cf96417494f3c8980c380908f459846139ab0f731c9e" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-50 ;
    cof:pageNumber "81"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Delegation of certain functions and powers is prohibited." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
