concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-53 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53 Appointment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-53 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner is to be appointed by the Governor-General by written instrument. Note: The Commissioner may be reappointed: see section 33AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901. (2) A person may be appointed as the Commissioner only if the person has appropriate qualifications, skills or experience to perform the functions of the position." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commissioner is to be appointed by the Governor-General by written instrument. Note: The Commissioner may be reappointed: see section 33AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901. (2) A person may be appointed as the Commissioner only if the person has appropriate qualifications, skills or experience to perform the functions of the position."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ec0a0620bcdd544fb2250c9fecc4daab0d50c1cd4bf8c26c60ae22c1ef5a861d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "83"^^xsd:integer ;
