concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-62 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "62 Membership of Council"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-62 ;
    values:originalText "Membership (1) The Council consists of the following members: (a) the Commissioner; (b) the Australian Statistician; (c) the Information Commissioner; (d) the Chief Scientist; (e) at least 5, and no more than 8, other members appointed by the Commissioner (the appointed members).  Chapter 4  National Data Commissioner and National Data Advisory Council" ;
    skos:definition "Membership (1) The Council consists of the following members: (a) the Commissioner; (b) the Australian Statistician; (c) the Information Commissioner; (d) the Chief Scientist; (e) at least 5, and no more than 8, other members appointed by the Commissioner (the appointed members).  Chapter 4  National Data Commissioner and National Data Advisory Council"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a48488599224ee47ba42adc0fc483629f4f01f9ffa3df0a549c378769499bcd0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "87"^^xsd:integer ;
