concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-63 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "63 Appointment of members"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-63 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The appointed members are to be appointed by the Commissioner by written instrument, on a part-time basis. (2) The Commissioner must ensure that appointed members are persons with qualifications, skills or experience that will help the Council perform its function." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The appointed members are to be appointed by the Commissioner by written instrument, on a part-time basis. (2) The Commissioner must ensure that appointed members are persons with qualifications, skills or experience that will help the Council perform its function."@en ;
