concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-75 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "75 Notice of accreditation decision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-75 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The accreditation authority must give the entity written notice of the authority’s decision under section 74, as soon as practicable after making the decision. (2) If the accreditation authority grants the entity the accreditation applied for, the notice must set out the following: (a) whether the entity is accredited as an ADSP or accredited user, or both; (b) the day the accreditation comes into force; (c) if the entity is accredited as an ADSP—that the accreditation must be renewed every 5 years (see paragraph 81(8)(a)); (d) if the authority decides to grant the accreditation with conditions of accreditation imposed by the authority: (i) those conditions; and (ii) the reasons for the decision; and (iii) the entity’s review rights under Part 6.2. (3) If the accreditation authority refuses to accredit the entity, the notice must set out the following:  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The accreditation authority must give the entity written notice of the authority’s decision under section 74, as soon as practicable after making the decision. (2) If the accreditation authority grants the entity the accreditation applied for, the notice must set out the following: (a) whether the entity is accredited as an ADSP or accredited user, or both; (b) the day the accreditation comes into force; (c) if the entity is accredited as an ADSP—that the accreditation must be renewed every 5 years (see paragraph 81(8)(a)); (d) if the authority decides to grant the accreditation with conditions of accreditation imposed by the authority: (i) those conditions; and (ii) the reasons for the decision; and (iii) the entity’s review rights under Part 6.2. (3) If the accreditation authority refuses to accredit the entity, the notice must set out the following:  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5c6513170043a02bc21504f2c68a95d72ba2090a3d22acb0d4c75a014c410949" ;
    cof:pageNumber "95"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-75-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-75-ss-2 ;
