concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-80 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80 Notice of conditions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-80 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The accreditation authority for an accredited entity must give the entity written notice of a decision made under section 78, as soon as practicable after making the decision. (2) The notice must: (a) state the condition or the variation, or state that the condition is removed; and  Regulation and enforcement  Chapter 5 Accreditation framework  Part 5.2 Conditions of accreditation  Division 2 Section 80 Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (b) state the day on which the condition, variation or removal takes effect; and (c) include a statement setting out the entity’s review rights under Part 6.2.  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The accreditation authority for an accredited entity must give the entity written notice of a decision made under section 78, as soon as practicable after making the decision. (2) The notice must: (a) state the condition or the variation, or state that the condition is removed; and  Regulation and enforcement  Chapter 5 Accreditation framework  Part 5.2 Conditions of accreditation  Division 2 Section 80 Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (b) state the day on which the condition, variation or removal takes effect; and (c) include a statement setting out the entity’s review rights under Part 6.2.  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9bcb042122f95dd6679aa1dada2fdfbee7fd617c6d6210797202e49d457bf9d6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "100"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-80-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-80-ss-2 ;
