doc:sec-80 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "80 Notice of conditions" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The accreditation authority for an accredited entity must give the entity written notice of a decision made under section 78, as soon as practicable after making the decision. (2) The notice must: (a) state the condition or the variation, or state that the condition is removed; and  Regulation and enforcement  Chapter 5 Accreditation framework  Part 5.2 Conditions of accreditation  Division 2 Section 80 Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (b) state the day on which the condition, variation or removal takes effect; and (c) include a statement setting out the entity’s review rights under Part 6.2.  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement" ;
    cof:pageNumber "100"^^xsd:integer .

