concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-81-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "81(5) Suspension or cancellation of accreditation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-81-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If an entity is a data scheme entity in more than one capacity, the accreditation authority may have regard to the entity’s conduct in any of those capacities for the purposes of subsections (1), (2), (3) and (4)." ;
    skos:definition "(5) If an entity is a data scheme entity in more than one capacity, the accreditation authority may have regard to the entity’s conduct in any of those capacities for the purposes of subsections (1), (2), (3) and (4)."@en ;
