doc:sec-81-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "81(5) Suspension or cancellation of accreditation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) If an entity is a data scheme entity in more than one capacity, the accreditation authority may have regard to the entity’s conduct in any of those capacities for the purposes of subsections (1), (2), (3) and (4)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "102"^^xsd:integer .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-81-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "81(6) Suspension or cancellation of accreditation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-81-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If, under paragraph (1)(c), there is a ground for suspending or cancelling an entity’s accreditation as an ADSP, the Commissioner must consider whether to do any of the following: (a) suspend or cancel the entity’s accreditation as an ADSP on that ground; (b) impose conditions of accreditation on the entity in its capacity as an ADSP, or vary any such conditions." ;
    skos:definition "(6) If, under paragraph (1)(c), there is a ground for suspending or cancelling an entity’s accreditation as an ADSP, the Commissioner must consider whether to do any of the following: (a) suspend or cancel the entity’s accreditation as an ADSP on that ground; (b) impose conditions of accreditation on the entity in its capacity as an ADSP, or vary any such conditions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "048c82d08306f6b2745dcd47820db6f77f4e0ebc05e5421d140308f8ceca8c99" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-81 ;
    cof:pageNumber "102"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Consider whether to suspend or cancel accreditation on a ground" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf> ;
