doc:sec-81-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "81(7) Suspension or cancellation of accreditation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) If, under paragraph (1)(d), there is a ground for suspending or cancelling an entity’s accreditation as an accredited user, the accreditation authority for the accredited user must consider whether to do any of the following: (a) suspend or cancel the entity’s accreditation as an accredited user on that ground; (b) impose conditions of accreditation on the entity in its capacity as an accredited user, or vary any such conditions. When accreditation must be suspended or cancelled" ;
    cof:pageNumber "102"^^xsd:integer .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-81-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "81(8) Suspension or cancellation of accreditation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-81-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) The Commissioner: (a) must suspend an entity’s accreditation as an ADSP if the entity fails to apply for renewal under section 85A within 5 years of the grant of accreditation under section 74 or its renewal under section 84, as applicable; and  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement" ;
    skos:definition "(8) The Commissioner: (a) must suspend an entity’s accreditation as an ADSP if the entity fails to apply for renewal under section 85A within 5 years of the grant of accreditation under section 74 or its renewal under section 84, as applicable; and  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cbaa045c5c711ea9b75d1e1d295630225c5c1f318da4b65fe3be5658076fe4bc" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-81 ;
    cof:pageNumber "102"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Suspension of accreditation if renewal is not applied for within 5 years." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf> ;
    dc:source "data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf, p.102" ;
