    skos:definition "(3) The notice must state the following: (a) if accreditation is suspended or cancelled—the circumstance that exists for the suspension or cancellation; (c) if accreditation is suspended—the period of suspension or that the suspension is indefinite;  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement"@en ;
