concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-86 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "86 Rules relating to the accreditation framework"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-86 ;
    values:originalText "The rules may provide for procedures, requirements and any other matters relating to the accreditation of entities for the purposes of the data sharing scheme. Note: The rules may prescribe fees in relation to services provided under the accreditation framework (see section 139)." ;
    skos:definition "The rules may provide for procedures, requirements and any other matters relating to the accreditation of entities for the purposes of the data sharing scheme. Note: The rules may prescribe fees in relation to services provided under the accreditation framework (see section 139)."@en ;
