concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-89 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "89 Respondents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-89 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the complaint is about an entity that is a Commonwealth body, the respondent is whichever of the following applies: (a) if the Commonwealth body is a body corporate or an individual—the Commonwealth body; (b) if the Commonwealth body is unincorporated—the principal executive of the Commonwealth body within the meaning of section 37 of the Privacy Act 1988. (2) If the complaint is about an entity that is not a Commonwealth body, the respondent is the entity.  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If the complaint is about an entity that is a Commonwealth body, the respondent is whichever of the following applies: (a) if the Commonwealth body is a body corporate or an individual—the Commonwealth body; (b) if the Commonwealth body is unincorporated—the principal executive of the Commonwealth body within the meaning of section 37 of the Privacy Act 1988. (2) If the complaint is about an entity that is not a Commonwealth body, the respondent is the entity.  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cbe0b556f15e47932dad3459155b9a00dd0e714c231d70f54fc5fe9b2fda2cc1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "111"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-89-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-89-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf> ;
    dc:source "data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf, p.111" .
