concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-99 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "99 Assessments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-99 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner may, from time to time, assess whether conduct that an entity engages or engaged in while it is or was a data scheme entity is consistent with the requirements of this Act. (2) The Commissioner may conduct an assessment in any manner the Commissioner considers appropriate. (3) The Commissioner may, for the purposes of an assessment, obtain information from any person, and make any inquiries, the Commissioner considers appropriate. Note: The Commissioner may require a person to give information or documents for the purposes of the Commissioner’s functions under this Part (see section 104), and may exercise powers under the Regulatory Powers Act to monitor compliance with certain provisions of this Act (see section 109). (4) If the Commissioner invites submissions in relation to an assessment, the Commissioner must have regard to any submissions made in response to the invitation." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commissioner may, from time to time, assess whether conduct that an entity engages or engaged in while it is or was a data scheme entity is consistent with the requirements of this Act. (2) The Commissioner may conduct an assessment in any manner the Commissioner considers appropriate. (3) The Commissioner may, for the purposes of an assessment, obtain information from any person, and make any inquiries, the Commissioner considers appropriate. Note: The Commissioner may require a person to give information or documents for the purposes of the Commissioner’s functions under this Part (see section 104), and may exercise powers under the Regulatory Powers Act to monitor compliance with certain provisions of this Act (see section 109). (4) If the Commissioner invites submissions in relation to an assessment, the Commissioner must have regard to any submissions made in response to the invitation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "67eb668ca91f4ed4a74f7d408180e75eb499b28a4415613981bd28d01771475d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "117"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-99-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-99-ss-2 ;
