concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-99-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "99(3) Assessments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-99-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Commissioner may, for the purposes of an assessment, obtain information from any person, and make any inquiries, the Commissioner considers appropriate. Note: The Commissioner may require a person to give information or documents for the purposes of the Commissioner’s functions under this Part (see section 104), and may exercise powers under the Regulatory Powers Act to monitor compliance with certain provisions of this Act (see section 109)." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The Commissioner may, for the purposes of an assessment, obtain information from any person, and make any inquiries, the Commissioner considers appropriate. Note: The Commissioner may require a person to give information or documents for the purposes of the Commissioner’s functions under this Part (see section 104), and may exercise powers under the Regulatory Powers Act to monitor compliance with certain provisions of this Act (see section 109)."@en ;
