concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-100 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "100 Notices of assessment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-100 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner must give an entity written notice before starting, and on completion of, an assessment of the operations of the entity. (2) The notice given before starting the assessment must specify the intended scope of the assessment." ;
