doc:sec-104-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "104(3) Power to require information and documents" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person is given a notice under subsection (1); and (b) the notice relates to an investigation under section 101; and (c) the person fails to comply with the notice. Penalty: Imprisonment for 6 months." ;
    cof:pageNumber "122"^^xsd:integer .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-104-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "104(4) Power to require information and documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-104-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the person produces a document to the Commissioner in compliance with the notice, the Commissioner: (a) may take possession of, and may make copies of, or take extracts from, the document; and (b) may retain possession of the document for any period necessary for the purposes of the investigation; and (c) must, during that period, permit any person who would be entitled to inspect the document if it were not in the  Regulation and enforcement  Chapter 5 Regulatory powers and enforcement  Part 5.5  Section 105 Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 Commissioner’s possession to inspect the document at any reasonable time." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the person produces a document to the Commissioner in compliance with the notice, the Commissioner: (a) may take possession of, and may make copies of, or take extracts from, the document; and (b) may retain possession of the document for any period necessary for the purposes of the investigation; and (c) must, during that period, permit any person who would be entitled to inspect the document if it were not in the  Regulation and enforcement  Chapter 5 Regulatory powers and enforcement  Part 5.5  Section 105 Data Availability and Transparency Act 2022 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 Commissioner’s possession to inspect the document at any reasonable time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9318cd55eb0309d1c2bf05a600b3a6f2ef5391f7f9e1ebad123f949cf61f68b0" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-104 ;
    cof:pageNumber "122"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commissioner may take possession of document for investigation purposes." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
