concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-110-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "110(2) Investigation powers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-110-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of Part 3 of the Regulatory Powers Act, as that Part applies in relation to evidential material that relates to a provision mentioned in subsection (1): (a) there are no related provisions; and (b) the Commissioner is an authorised applicant; and (c) the Commissioner is an authorised person; and (d) any judicial officer within the meaning of the Regulatory Powers Act is an issuing officer; and (e) the Commissioner is the relevant chief executive; and (f) each of the following is a relevant court: (i) the Federal Court; (ii) the Circuit Court; (iii) a court of a State or Territory that has jurisdiction in relation to matters arising under this Act.  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement" ;
    skos:definition "(2) For the purposes of Part 3 of the Regulatory Powers Act, as that Part applies in relation to evidential material that relates to a provision mentioned in subsection (1): (a) there are no related provisions; and (b) the Commissioner is an authorised applicant; and (c) the Commissioner is an authorised person; and (d) any judicial officer within the meaning of the Regulatory Powers Act is an issuing officer; and (e) the Commissioner is the relevant chief executive; and (f) each of the following is a relevant court: (i) the Federal Court; (ii) the Circuit Court; (iii) a court of a State or Territory that has jurisdiction in relation to matters arising under this Act.  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement"@en ;
