concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-115 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "115 Enforceable undertakings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-115 ;
    values:originalText "Enforceable provisions (1) The provisions of this Act are enforceable under Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act. Note: Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act creates a framework for accepting and enforcing undertakings relating to compliance with provisions.  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement" ;
    skos:definition "Enforceable provisions (1) The provisions of this Act are enforceable under Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act. Note: Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act creates a framework for accepting and enforcing undertakings relating to compliance with provisions.  Chapter 5  Regulation and enforcement"@en ;
