concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-118-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "118(2) Reviewable decisions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-118-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Each of the following decisions made by the Minister is also a reviewable decision: (a) a decision to accredit an entity with conditions of accreditation imposed by the Minister, or to refuse to accredit the entity; (b) a decision under section 78 to impose conditions of accreditation on an accredited entity, or vary them;  Chapter 6  Other matters" ;
