concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-119 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "119 Applications for reconsideration of decisions made by delegates"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-119 ;
    values:originalText "of the reviewer (1) If a person is affected by a reviewable decision made by a delegate of the reviewer for the decision, the person may apply to the reviewer for reconsideration of the decision. (2) The application must: (a) be in an approved form (if any); and (b) set out the reasons for the application. (3) If the rules prescribe a fee for making an application under this section, the application is taken not to have been made unless the fee is paid." ;
    skos:definition "of the reviewer (1) If a person is affected by a reviewable decision made by a delegate of the reviewer for the decision, the person may apply to the reviewer for reconsideration of the decision. (2) The application must: (a) be in an approved form (if any); and (b) set out the reasons for the application. (3) If the rules prescribe a fee for making an application under this section, the application is taken not to have been made unless the fee is paid."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8cce1d85732030709ab3ab29572391c6fac9eb8dbde69fe8a6838c6593600429" ;
    cof:pageNumber "138"^^xsd:integer ;
