concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-120-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "120(5) Reconsideration by reviewer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-120-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If the reviewer’s functions under this section are performed by a delegate of the reviewer, the delegate who reconsiders the reviewable decision: (a) must not have been involved in making the reviewable decision; and (b) must hold a position, or perform duties, of at least the same level as the delegate who made the reviewable decision. Note: The Commissioner may delegate functions and powers to members of staff (see section 50). The Minister may delegate functions and powers to the Commissioner (see section 137A)." ;
    skos:definition "(5) If the reviewer’s functions under this section are performed by a delegate of the reviewer, the delegate who reconsiders the reviewable decision: (a) must not have been involved in making the reviewable decision; and (b) must hold a position, or perform duties, of at least the same level as the delegate who made the reviewable decision. Note: The Commissioner may delegate functions and powers to members of staff (see section 50). The Minister may delegate functions and powers to the Commissioner (see section 137A)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "370e2418792c2ab6a721a376844b9e353fe1a4c28ce38fa556e9be3f177a22dd" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-120 ;
    cof:pageNumber "138"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Delegate must not have been involved in making the reviewable decision and hold a position of at least the same level as the delegate who made the reviewable decision." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf> ;
    dc:source "data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf, p.138" ;
