doc:sec-124-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "124(2) Extension of authorisations to share, collect or use data" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply to conduct of an individual if either of the following has the effect that the individual may not engage in such conduct: (a) conditions of accreditation imposed on or applicable to the entity; (b) the data sharing agreement that covers the sharing, collection or use. Bodies corporate" ;
    cof:pageNumber "141"^^xsd:integer .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-124-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "124(3) Extension of authorisations to share, collect or use data"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-124-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) An authorisation in Chapter 2 for an accredited entity to collect or use data also authorises a body corporate that is party to an approved contract with the accredited entity to engage in conduct that is, or is part of, the collection or use, if the conduct is within the actual scope of the approved contract." ;
    skos:definition "(3) An authorisation in Chapter 2 for an accredited entity to collect or use data also authorises a body corporate that is party to an approved contract with the accredited entity to engage in conduct that is, or is part of, the collection or use, if the conduct is within the actual scope of the approved contract."@en ;
