    cof:title "129(1) Register of accredited users" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner must maintain a register of accredited users. The register must include a publicly accessible part and may include a part that is not publicly accessible." ;
    cof:pageNumber "148"^^xsd:integer .

concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-129-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "129(2) Register of accredited users"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-129-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subject to subsection (4), the Commissioner must include in the part of the register that is publicly accessible the following details for each accredited user: (a) the name of the accredited user; (b) contact details for the accredited user; (c) conditions of the accredited user’s accreditation; (d) at any time while the accredited user’s accreditation is suspended—the duration of the suspension (which may be indefinite); (e) any other details prescribed by the rules to be included in the publicly accessible part of the register." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Subject to subsection (4), the Commissioner must include in the part of the register that is publicly accessible the following details for each accredited user: (a) the name of the accredited user; (b) contact details for the accredited user; (c) conditions of the accredited user’s accreditation; (d) at any time while the accredited user’s accreditation is suspended—the duration of the suspension (which may be indefinite); (e) any other details prescribed by the rules to be included in the publicly accessible part of the register."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4fff2086a696983de95f5ba2077899ce7ce46e91199063b6e153ea8829cc7462" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-129 ;
    cof:pageNumber "148"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Commissioner must include certain details in the publicly accessible part of the register for each accredited user." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
