concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-133 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "133 Rules"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-133 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules prescribing matters: (a) required or permitted by this Act to be prescribed by the rules; or (b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this Act. (2) To avoid doubt, the rules may not do the following: (a) create an offence or civil penalty; (b) provide powers of: (i) arrest or detention; or (ii) entry, search or seizure; (c) impose a tax; (d) set an amount to be appropriated from the Consolidated Revenue Fund under an appropriation in this Act;  Chapter 6  Other matters" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules prescribing matters: (a) required or permitted by this Act to be prescribed by the rules; or (b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this Act. (2) To avoid doubt, the rules may not do the following: (a) create an offence or civil penalty; (b) provide powers of: (i) arrest or detention; or (ii) entry, search or seizure; (c) impose a tax; (d) set an amount to be appropriated from the Consolidated Revenue Fund under an appropriation in this Act;  Chapter 6  Other matters"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "90e1731da669316c69d25dcf438df140eb607b17c2c30b39a12d403bbadb9303" ;
    cof:pageNumber "151"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-133-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-133-ss-2 ;
