concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-135 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "135 Disclosure of scheme data in relation to information-gathering"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-135 ;
    values:originalText "powers A data scheme entity is authorised to disclose scheme data held by the entity: (a) to the Auditor-General, if the disclosure is required under the Auditor-General Act 1997; or (b) to the Commonwealth Ombudsman, if the disclosure is requested or required under the Ombudsman Act 1976; or (c) to the Information Commissioner, if the disclosure is required under the Freedom of Information Act 1982 or the Privacy Act 1988; or (d) to a court or tribunal of the Commonwealth or a State or Territory, or a Royal Commission (within the meaning of the Royal Commissions Act 1902), that orders or directs the disclosure. Note 1: Except as authorised by this section, data scheme entities must not provide access to scheme data unless authorised to do so by Chapter 2 or by a direction under section 112. Note 2: Section 23 (authorisations override other laws) applies only in relation to provision of access to data authorised by Chapter 2." ;
    skos:definition "powers A data scheme entity is authorised to disclose scheme data held by the entity: (a) to the Auditor-General, if the disclosure is required under the Auditor-General Act 1997; or (b) to the Commonwealth Ombudsman, if the disclosure is requested or required under the Ombudsman Act 1976; or (c) to the Information Commissioner, if the disclosure is required under the Freedom of Information Act 1982 or the Privacy Act 1988; or (d) to a court or tribunal of the Commonwealth or a State or Territory, or a Royal Commission (within the meaning of the Royal Commissions Act 1902), that orders or directs the disclosure. Note 1: Except as authorised by this section, data scheme entities must not provide access to scheme data unless authorised to do so by Chapter 2 or by a direction under section 112. Note 2: Section 23 (authorisations override other laws) applies only in relation to provision of access to data authorised by Chapter 2."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6b86753b7d6f60176680ee85dc0912c21911656f9233270285462a1999d63b94" ;
    cof:pageNumber "153"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Data scheme entities must not provide access to scheme data unless authorised." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf> ;
    dc:source "data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022.pdf, p.153" ;
    cml:asserts concept:data-availability-and-transparency-act-2022-sec-135-norm .
