doc:sec-139 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "139 Charging of fees by Commissioner" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The rules may prescribe fees to be charged by the Commissioner for services provided by or on behalf of the Commissioner, or for or on behalf of the Minister in the Minister’s capacity as an accreditation authority for an entity, in performing or exercising functions or powers under this Act, the rules or the data codes.  Chapter 6  Other matters" ;
