    cof:title "143(7) Sunset of the data sharing scheme" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) The regulations may prescribe: (a) penalties, not exceeding 50 penalty units for individuals and entities other than bodies corporate or 250 penalty units for bodies corporate, for offences against the regulations; and (b) civil penalties, not exceeding 300 penalty units for individuals and entities other than bodies corporate or 1,500 penalty units for bodies corporate, for contraventions of the regulations." ;
